{
  "what_this_is": "The EUROCONTROL SAC allocation tables as retrieved, pinned so the CAT021 fixtures' choice of System Area Code rests on evidence rather than on an assertion in a test. House style: fixtures/legion/spec/openapi_pin.json and airtasking/SOURCES.md.",
  "source": {
    "document": "EUROCONTROL ASTERIX — System Area Code (SAC) allocation tables",
    "url": "https://www.eurocontrol.int/asterix",
    "form": "HTML page; the tables are embedded in the page, not offered as a download. There is no standalone SAC list document and no downloadable artefact to pin: https://www.eurocontrol.int/services/system-area-code-list, cited by older ASTERIX specifications, returns 404.",
